# Node Version Management

This project uses nvm. The required Node.js version is defined in `.nvmrc` (currently `v24.14.0`).

Before running any `node`, `npm`, `pnpm`, or `npx` commands, always activate the correct version:

```bash
nvm use
```

This reads `.nvmrc` and switches to the declared version automatically.

If the version is not installed yet:

```bash
nvm install
```
